<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>YashiMart | Shop Smart</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="topline">✨ Welcome to YashiMart — little finds, great prices!</div>
<header class="header">
  <a class="logo" href="#" onclick="showPage('shop')">Yashi<span>Mart</span><small>SHOP SMART. LIVE BETTER.</small></a>
  <div class="search"><select id="category" onchange="loadProducts()"><option>All</option><option>Electronics</option><option>Fashion</option><option>Home</option><option>Beauty</option><option>Other</option></select><input id="search" placeholder="Search for products, brands and more..." oninput="loadProducts()"><button onclick="loadProducts()">⌕</button></div>
  <div class="header-actions"><button onclick="openAuth()">👤 <span>Account</span></button><button onclick="showPage('orders')">📦 <span>Orders</span></button><button onclick="showPage('cart')">🛒 <span>Cart <b id="cartCount">0</b></span></button></div>
</header>
<nav class="nav"><a onclick="filterCat('All')">All Products</a><a onclick="filterCat('Electronics')">Electronics</a><a onclick="filterCat('Fashion')">Fashion</a><a onclick="filterCat('Home')">Home & Living</a><a onclick="showPage('seller')">Sell on YashiMart</a><a onclick="showPage('admin')">Admin</a></nav>
<main id="shopPage">
<section class="hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE EVERYDAY SHOPPING FEST</span><h1>Good things.<br><em>Great prices.</em></h1><p>Find your favourites in one happy place.</p><button class="primary" onclick="document.getElementById('products').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Explore products&nbsp; →</button><div class="hero-points"><span>✓ Easy shopping</span><span>✓ Secure checkout demo</span><span>✓ Fresh picks</span></div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="hero-circle"></div><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556740472-8b8b8b8b8b8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" onerror="this.src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542291026-7eec264c27ff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80'"><div class="float-tag">✨ Today's picks</div></div></section>
<section class="benefits"><div>🚚 <b>Easy ordering</b><small>Simple checkout flow</small></div><div>💎 <b>Handpicked finds</b><small>Everyday essentials</small></div><div>↩️ <b>Order history</b><small>Keep track in one place</small></div><div>💬 <b>Reviews</b><small>Share your experience</small></div></section>
<section class="section" id="products"><div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">MADE FOR YOUR EVERYDAY</span><h2>Popular right now <span>✦</span></h2></div><span id="resultCount" class="muted"></span></div><div id="productGrid" class="grid"><div class="loading">Loading products…</div></div></section>
<section class="newsletter"><div><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE HAPPY IN YOUR INBOX</span><h2>Discover something lovely.</h2><p>Explore useful finds for study, home and everyday life.</p></div><button class="secondary" onclick="showToast('Thanks for visiting YashiMart!')">Explore the collection →</button></section>
</main>
<main id="cartPage" class="section hidden"><div class="section-title"><h2>Your Shopping Cart 🛒</h2><button class="secondary" onclick="showPage('shop')">← Continue shopping</button></div><div id="cartItems"></div><div id="cartSummary" class="summary"></div></main>
<main id="ordersPage" class="section hidden"><h2>Your Orders 📦</h2><p class="muted">Enter the email you used at checkout to view order history.</p><div class="inline-form"><input id="orderEmail" placeholder="your@email.com"><button class="primary" onclick="loadOrders()">View orders</button></div><div id="orderList"></div></main>
<main id="sellerPage" class="section hidden"><h2>Seller Studio ✨</h2><p class="muted">Add a product to the store. This demo form sends product details to the C++ backend.</p><div class="form-card"><div class="form-grid"><label>Product name<input id="pName" placeholder="e.g. Cotton tote bag"></label><label>Category<select id="pCategory"><option>Electronics</option><option>Fashion</option><option>Home</option><option>Beauty</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label>Price (₹)<input id="pPrice" type="number" min="1" placeholder="499"></label><label>Stock<input id="pStock" type="number" min="1" value="10"></label><label class="wide">Image URL<input id="pImage" placeholder="https://... product image URL"></label><label class="wide">Description<textarea id="pDescription" placeholder="Describe the product"></textarea></label></div><button class="primary" onclick="addProduct()">＋ Add product</button></div><h3>Manage products</h3><div id="sellerProducts"></div></main>
<main id="adminPage" class="section hidden"><h2>Admin dashboard 🛠️</h2><p class="muted">Demo admin credentials: <b>admin@yashimart.local</b> / <b>admin123</b>. For classroom demonstration only.</p><div class="admin-actions"><button class="primary" onclick="loadAdmin('users')">View users</button><button class="primary" onclick="loadAdmin('orders')">View all orders</button><button class="secondary" onclick="loadProducts()">Refresh product catalogue</button></div><div id="adminList"></div></main>
<footer><div class="logo">Yashi<span>Mart</span></div><p>Made for everyday discoveries. A student capstone demonstration project.</p><div class="footerlinks"><span>About</span><span>Help Centre</span><span>Privacy</span><span>Terms</span></div><small>© 2026 YashiMart · Educational demo · No real payments are processed.</small></footer>
<div id="authModal" class="modal hidden"><div class="modal-box"><button class="close" onclick="closeAuth()">×</button><div class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO YASHIMART</div><h2 id="authTitle">Login</h2><div class="tabs"><button class="tab active" onclick="setAuthMode('login')">Login</button><button class="tab" onclick="setAuthMode('register')">Create account</button></div><label id="authNameWrap" class="hidden">Full name<input id="authName" placeholder="Your name"></label><label>Email<input id="authEmail" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com"></label><label>Password<input id="authPassword" type="password" placeholder="At least 4 characters"></label><label>Account type<select id="authRole"><option value="buyer">Buyer</option><option value="seller">Seller</option><option value="admin">Admin</option></select></label><button class="primary full" onclick="submitAuth()">Continue →</button><p id="authMsg" class="form-msg"></p><small>Demo only: do not use a real password.</small></div></div>
<div id="toast" class="toast"></div><script src="app.js"></script>
</body></html>
